.email-header
  h1 Magic Link Login

.email-content
  p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;"
    | Click the button below to log in and view your cases:

  .text-center style="margin: 32px 0;"
    = link_to "Log In to View My Cases", @login_url, class: "button", style: "display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; background-color: #7c3aed; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;"

  .info-box style="background-color: #eff6ff; border-left-color: #3b82f6;"
    p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #1e40af;"
      | Important:
    p style="margin: 0; color: #1e3a8a; font-size: 14px;"
      | This link will expire in 1 hour. If you didn't request this link, you can safely ignore this email.

  p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 24px;"
    | Or copy and paste this URL into your browser:
    br
    = link_to @login_url, @login_url, style: "color: #7c3aed; text-decoration: underline; word-break: break-all; font-size: 12px;"
